Upstream: https://github.com/uBlockOrigin/uBOL-home/tree/0d79e9ea78e8bfe31fa139abbce5d63957638fa3
Original bytes and exact transformation are included in the source stage. This is not uBlock Origin Lite and does not implement its full filtering behavior.
Additional cosmetic selectors are parsed as data from EasyList compiled by the same pinned uBlock Origin Lite commit. Upstream executable code is not shipped. Generic filtering is omitted on all listed exception hosts. Owner rules are authored, browser-only firmware endpoint-domain seeds and their subdomains; they do not provide complete device network isolation.
